@startuml Purchase Order Management - Sequence Diagram

skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceActorFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceBoxFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontName Times New Roman

title Sequence Diagram - Manajemen Purchase Order (Admin Gudang)

actor "Admin Gudang" as Admin
participant "Filament UI" as UI
participant "PO Resource" as Resource
participant "PurchaseOrder\nModel" as PO
participant "Database" as DB
participant "Notification" as Notif

== Buat PO ==
Admin -> UI: Akses menu Purchase Order
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request PO list
activate Resource
Resource -> PO: Get all POs
activate PO
PO -> DB: Query purchase orders
activate DB
DB --> PO: Return data
deactivate DB
PO --> Resource: Collection<PO>
deactivate PO
Resource --> UI: PO list data
deactivate Resource
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan daftar PO
deactivate UI

Admin -> UI: Klik "Buat PO"
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Show create form
activate Resource
Resource --> UI: Form dengan supplier & produk
deactivate Resource
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan form
deactivate UI

Admin -> UI: Pilih supplier\nInput detail PO\nInput detail produk
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Submit PO data
activate Resource

note right of Resource
    - Generate nomor PO
    - Hitung total amount
    - Set status = Pending
end note

Resource -> PO: Create PO with details
activate PO
PO -> DB: Save PO & details
activate DB
DB --> PO: Success
deactivate DB
PO --> Resource: PurchaseOrder instance
deactivate PO

Resource -> Notif: Send notification to Supplier
activate Notif
Notif --> Resource: Sent
deactivate Notif

Resource --> UI: Success response
deactivate Resource
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan hasil
deactivate UI

== Edit PO ==
Admin -> UI: Pilih Purchase Order\nKlik Edit
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request edit form
activate Resource
Resource -> PO: Find PO by ID
activate PO
PO -> DB: Query PO
activate DB
DB --> PO: PO data
deactivate DB

alt Status = Pending
    PO --> Resource: PurchaseOrder instance
    deactivate PO
    Resource --> UI: Edit form with data
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: Tampilkan form edit
    deactivate UI

    Admin -> UI: Update data PO
    activate UI
    UI -> Resource: Submit updated data
    activate Resource

    note right of Resource
        - Update PO data
        - Update detail produk
        - Hitung ulang total amount
    end note

    Resource -> PO: Update PO
    activate PO
    PO -> DB: Save changes
    activate DB
    DB --> PO: Success
    deactivate DB
    PO --> Resource: Updated instance
    deactivate PO

    Resource --> UI: Success response
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: Tampilkan hasil
    deactivate UI
else Status != Pending
    PO --> Resource: PO not editable
    deactivate PO
    Resource --> UI: Error response
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: Tampilkan error\n"PO tidak dapat diubah"
    deactivate UI
end

== Lihat PO ==
Admin -> UI: Pilih PO untuk detail
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request PO details
activate Resource
Resource -> PO: Get PO with relations
activate PO
PO -> DB: Query with supplier & details
activate DB
DB --> PO: Complete data
deactivate DB
PO --> Resource: PurchaseOrder with details
deactivate PO
Resource --> UI: PO detail data
deactivate Resource
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan detail PO
deactivate UI

== Batalkan PO ==
Admin -> UI: Pilih PO\nKlik Batalkan
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request cancel
activate Resource
Resource -> PO: Find PO by ID
activate PO
PO -> DB: Query PO
activate DB
DB --> PO: PO data
deactivate DB

alt Status = Pending
    note right of PO
        Set status = Cancelled
    end note

    PO -> DB: Update status
    activate DB
    DB --> PO: Success
    deactivate DB
    PO --> Resource: Updated instance
    deactivate PO

    Resource -> Notif: Send notification to Supplier
    activate Notif
    Notif --> Resource: Sent
    deactivate Notif

    Resource --> UI: Success response
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: Tampilkan hasil\n"PO dibatalkan"
    deactivate UI
else Status != Pending
    PO --> Resource: Cannot cancel
    deactivate PO
    Resource --> UI: Error response
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: Tampilkan error\n"PO tidak dapat dibatalkan"
    deactivate UI
end

@enduml
